JenkSpotter

Icons
-----
src/main/resources/META-INF/pluginIcon.svg and pluginIcon_dark.svg are derived from the Jenkins
logo (art/jenkins-original.svg) created by Charles Lowell and Frontside for the Jenkins project,
https://jenkins.io/. The original and the derived icons are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported License, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/.
Changes: recoloured, hair, round glasses and lightning scar added (tools/generate_icons.py).

The 16px icons in src/main/resources/icons are simplified drawings in the same style and are
distributed under the same licence.

Sounds
------
src/main/resources/sounds/*.wav are synthesised by tools/generate_sounds.py and contain no
third-party samples.

